    {
      "id": "claim_2c3f6f1238364043b89054156b0f1705",
      "statement": "The momentum sleeve is bull-biased by construction and carries crash risk at trend reversals, and several of its entries are single-name or narrow-universe proxies for cross-sectional designs — George & Hwang's 52-week-high proxy strips the cross-sectional component, and the TSMOM adaptation is long/flat where the paper is long and short across many assets.",
      "evidence": [
