    {
      "id": "claim_ebd79f7ca9cd4c4887074091f279d197",
      "statement": "The two baseline entries are not alpha bets: pipeline_buy_hold is the long-only SPY benchmark whose results are regenerated over 2004-01-02 to 2026-04-30 so the window spans the 2008-09 crisis and the 2022 correction, and capital_preservation_tbill is the defensive destination the trend filters rotate into, mapping to the fixed_income and conservative risk profiles.",
